# Hard-scenario local/CI artifacts (checksums recorded in the report, binaries not committed)
artifacts/
.r1-security-campaign.lock

# Mutation-harness backups. `scripts/r1/mutations/*.mjs` rewrite a source file in place and
# restore it from a sibling .bak when the campaign ends. Committing during a run captures the
# MUTATED file — a deliberately broken boundary — plus the backup. It happened twice before this
# line existed, so the harness's working files are now unstageable rather than merely discouraged.
*.up.sql.bak
*.ts.bak
*.tsx.bak
